# Build context is the repo root. Keep it small and never ship secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/src/generated

# Secrets — never bake into an image layer
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# VCS / tooling / local junk
.git
.github
.husky
.claude
**/logs
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.DS_Store

# Not needed inside images
Jenkinsfile
compose*.yaml
**/README.md
**/ARCHITECTURE.md
SUBMISSION_SUMMARY.md
